<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17067" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀτθίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Attic,</i> esp. (with or without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>) <i>Attica,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				247
			</span></i> (lyr.) (unless <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίδας ναῦς</span>
			be read); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆς ἀπ᾽ Ἀτθίδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epin.
					1.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλῶττα</span>) <i>the Attic dialect,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.1.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱστορία</span>) <i>history of Athens,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ τὴν᾽ Ἀ. συγγράψαντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.1.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				1.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>Athens,</i> written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθθίς</span> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pae.Delph.</u>
				8
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				14
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
